    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.poster.avif?t=1749656302\" width=620 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.webm?t=1749656302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.mp4?t=1749656302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next addition to the <strong>Beach Invasion</strong> game series, this time bringing the players to defend against the greatest amphibious operation during the <strong>First World War</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/35da09e1c0fdf65219f89f21a43e747a.poster.avif?t=1749656302\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/35da09e1c0fdf65219f89f21a43e747a.webm?t=1749656302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/35da09e1c0fdf65219f89f21a43e747a.mp4?t=1749656302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this FPS/Tower defense game,  players defend the beach fortifications against invading forces who will attack your position with troops, armored cars, biplanes, planes and more! Use a variety of iconic and authentic WWI weapons stretching from machine guns to coastal artillery, and field cannons to anti-air guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/30463c8975ab126793c84623b33839cd.poster.avif?t=1749656302\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/30463c8975ab126793c84623b33839cd.webm?t=1749656302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/30463c8975ab126793c84623b33839cd.mp4?t=1749656302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Beach Invasion 1915-Gallipoli</strong> brings  modern FPS realism to arcade style on-rail shooter game mechanics. The players can choose to play two scenarios; in the first as a Turkish soldier\u00a0  defending the beaches of Gallipoli, in the second one as a British soldier defending the Suez Canal. Moreover they can play together with friends in online <strong>CO-OP gamemode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/59bb3f653c9e11e1eae2815eec377f33.poster.avif?t=1749656302\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/59bb3f653c9e11e1eae2815eec377f33.webm?t=1749656302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/59bb3f653c9e11e1eae2815eec377f33.mp4?t=1749656302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During these immense amphibious  operations,  player's task is to destroy as many of the invading forces as possible in continous waves, utilizing a variety of weapons and bonuses from the supply drops, such as\u00a0Poison Gas, Armor Piercing, Explosive and Incendiary ammunition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compared to previous games in the franchise, players can now determine the <strong>precise location</strong> of where they want the <strong>artillery fire</strong> to hit. <strong>New enemies</strong> include infantry who will  charge with their <strong>bayonets</strong>, <strong>armored cars</strong>, <strong>motorcycles</strong>,  <strong>bi-planes</strong> and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.poster.avif?t=1749656302\" width=620 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.webm?t=1749656302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.mp4?t=1749656302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next addition to the <strong>Beach Invasion</strong> game series, this time bringing the players to defend against the greatest amphibious operation during the <strong>First World War</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/35da09e1c0fdf65219f89f21a43e747a.poster.avif?t=1749656302\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/35da09e1c0fdf65219f89f21a43e747a.webm?t=1749656302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/35da09e1c0fdf65219f89f21a43e747a.mp4?t=1749656302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this FPS/Tower defense game,  players defend the beach fortifications against invading forces who will attack your position with troops, armored cars, biplanes, planes and more! Use a variety of iconic and authentic WWI weapons stretching from machine guns to coastal artillery, and field cannons to anti-air guns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/30463c8975ab126793c84623b33839cd.poster.avif?t=1749656302\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/30463c8975ab126793c84623b33839cd.webm?t=1749656302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/30463c8975ab126793c84623b33839cd.mp4?t=1749656302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Beach Invasion 1915-Gallipoli</strong> brings  modern FPS realism to arcade style on-rail shooter game mechanics. The players can choose to play two scenarios; in the first as a Turkish soldier\u00a0  defending the beaches of Gallipoli, in the second one as a British soldier defending the Suez Canal. Moreover they can play together with friends in online <strong>CO-OP gamemode</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/59bb3f653c9e11e1eae2815eec377f33.poster.avif?t=1749656302\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/59bb3f653c9e11e1eae2815eec377f33.webm?t=1749656302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3556670/extras/59bb3f653c9e11e1eae2815eec377f33.mp4?t=1749656302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During these immense amphibious  operations,  player's task is to destroy as many of the invading forces as possible in continous waves, utilizing a variety of weapons and bonuses from the supply drops, such as\u00a0Poison Gas, Armor Piercing, Explosive and Incendiary ammunition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compared to previous games in the franchise, players can now determine the <strong>precise location</strong> of where they want the <strong>artillery fire</strong> to hit. <strong>New enemies</strong> include infantry who will  charge with their <strong>bayonets</strong>, <strong>armored cars</strong>, <strong>motorcycles</strong>,  <strong>bi-planes</strong> and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
